<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#f6faf7', padding: '48px 60px' }}>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0f3d22' }}>多模态 + 用户体验：图文速查与四态设计</Text>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, marginTop: 24, flex: 1 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#fff', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #e2ece5', padding: 16, gap: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0f3d22' }}>📷 图文速查（图谱页双模式）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#4b5563', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          拍照识别：VL 模型识别 + 置信度进度条 + 图谱详情跳转<br />
          症状勾选：聚合 14 个高频症状关键词，勾选实时匹配，显示命中项<br />
          照片无病斑 → 友好提示重拍，不报错（真实 bug 修复案例）
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#fff', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #e2ece5', padding: 16, gap: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0f3d22' }}>🧓 适老化设计</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#4b5563', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>大字体基准（16px 起，宽屏 18px）· 3 步完成诊断 · 口语化问答 · 语音播报 · 全屏视频登录页</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#fff', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #e2ece5', padding: 16, gap: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0f3d22' }}>🔐 完整账号体系</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#4b5563', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>密码 / 手机邮箱验证码 / 微信支付宝 OAuth / 自研跨设备扫码登录（无需第三方资质，Playwright 端到端验证）</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 10 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0f3d22' }}>四种界面状态全部有设计（答辩证据）</Text>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 6 }}>
          <Image src="/workspace/shanqu-diagnosis/docs/screenshots/state-1-loading.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: 128, borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #d8e4da', objectFit: 'cover' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#374151', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>① 加载中：骨架屏</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 6 }}>
          <Image src="/workspace/shanqu-diagnosis/docs/screenshots/state-2-empty.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: 128, borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #d8e4da', objectFit: 'cover' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#374151', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>② 空状态：引导文案</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 6 }}>
          <Image src="/workspace/shanqu-diagnosis/docs/screenshots/state-3-error.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: 128, borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #d8e4da', objectFit: 'cover' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#374151', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>③ 报错：校验提示</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 6 }}>
          <Image src="/workspace/shanqu-diagnosis/docs/screenshots/state-4-system.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: 128, borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #d8e4da', objectFit: 'cover' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#374151', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>④ 降级/超时：系统状态页</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
